  "bodyHash": "OCbc5n74LfM=",
  "content": "<p><strong><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:24px\">Plenty Plates 模組已於 2025-07-02 停止維護。</span></strong></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/plentyplates/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/plentyplates/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/Fusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=twitter&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2l26SuCmCNSCPefpfbCX7Q\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/heyitsfuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Patreon&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=patreon&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fhosted_button_id%253dTYG7QUSWMVSNG\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=PayPal&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=paypal&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"107\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/plentyplates/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Plenty Plates 是一款專注於「壓力」的模組！確切來說是壓力板。新增了多種壓力板類型，可偵測各種實體。不僅如此！放置後還能高度自訂每塊壓力板，例如設為靜音或隱藏狀態。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/plentyplates/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">所有新型壓力板均可像按鈕一樣放置在方塊的六個面上！</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">透過 Shift + 右鍵開啟壓力板選單，可設定白名單或黑名單篩選條件，並使壓力板靜音、隱藏甚至發光。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">黑曜石壓力板用於偵測玩家，可篩選特定玩家名稱。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">鵝卵石壓力板用於偵測所有生物，可篩選特定生物。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">苔石壓力板用於偵測物品，便於過濾特定物品。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">石磚壓力板可偵測生物，甚至能區分成年與幼年個體。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">苔石磚壓力板用於偵測村民，可按職業篩選。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">雕紋石磚壓力板僅對羊觸發，但可設定為只對特定羊毛顏色反應。</span></strong></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/plentyplates/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/plentyplates/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/plentyplates/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/plentyplates/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需在客戶端與伺服器端安裝</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（適用於 Forge 與 Fabric）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Fabric 版本）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Fabric 版本）</span></strong></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/plentyplates/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可透過遊戲內模組選單直接輕鬆設定（Fabric 版本需安裝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，由 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/prospectordev\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 開發），並安裝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/configured\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Configured</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 或 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/configured-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Configured (Fabric)</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（由 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mrcrayfish\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MrCrayfish</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 開發）。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">手動設定時，所有檔案位於 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 資料夾，命名為 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（依設定類型而定）。本模組可能不存在所有類型設定檔。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">注意：舊版模組的伺服器設定檔位於 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">.minecraft/saves/WORLD_NAME/serverconfigs</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，意味著需為每個世界單獨設定。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/plentyplates/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">特別感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/myrathi\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Myrathi</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 及其舊版 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obsidiplates\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">ObsidiPlates</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 模組，這是我喜愛並作為本模組主要靈感來源的作品。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">同時感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/covert_jaguar\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Covert_Jaguar</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 及其 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/railcraft\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Railcraft</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 模組，多數壓力板類型基於 Railcraft 的偵測器設計。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/plentyplates/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/heyitsfuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/support.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/plentyplates/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ender-zoology\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tiny-skeletons-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mob-lassos\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/moblassos/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/portable-hole\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/portablehole/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/magnum-torch-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/magnumtorch/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/distinguished-potions\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/distinguishedpotions/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-magic\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easymagic/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-tridents\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bettertridents/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/permanent-sponges\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/permanentsponges/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-monsters\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/plentyplates/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p",
